{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Elinor Barker (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Elinor_Barker\" title=\"Elinor Barker\">Elinor Barker</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> won an Olympic medal while pregnant?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elinor_Barker","retrieved":1772819819430},{"title":"a 2025 adventure film (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a tram chase sequence in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dora_and_the_Search_for_Sol_Dorado\" title=\"Dora and the Search for Sol Dorado\">a 2025 adventure film</a></b> was shot in two different theme parks, and with two different trams?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dora_and_the_Search_for_Sol_Dorado","retrieved":1772819819433},{"title":"Miroslava Pešíková (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Miroslava_Pe%C5%A1%C3%ADkov%C3%A1\" title=\"Miroslava Pešíková\">Miroslava Pešíková</a></b> was a ballerina at the <a href=\"/wiki/National_Theatre_(Prague)\" title=\"National Theatre (Prague)\">National Theatre</a> in Prague for 28 years in 47 roles?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miroslava_Pe%C5%A1%C3%ADkov%C3%A1","retrieved":1772819819435},{"title":"first session of the United Nations General Assembly (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a href=\"/wiki/First_session_of_the_United_Nations_General_Assembly\" title=\"First session of the United Nations General Assembly\">first session of the United Nations General Assembly</a></b> was held in a church in war-damaged London only four months after the end of World War&nbsp;II?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_session_of_the_United_Nations_General_Assembly","retrieved":1772819819439},{"title":"Joan Salter (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the Holocaust survivor <b><a href=\"/wiki/Joan_Salter\" title=\"Joan Salter\">Joan Salter</a></b> returned from America to parents she could not remember?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joan_Salter","retrieved":1772819819441},{"title":"Seven Samurai (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Seven_Samurai\" title=\"Seven Samurai\">Seven Samurai</a></b></i> is considered one of the greatest films ever made?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seven_Samurai","retrieved":1772819819627},{"title":"Sadiku (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that despite its hardline Islamic beliefs, a Boko Haram faction led by <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sadiku_(Boko_Haram)\" title=\"Sadiku (Boko Haram)\">Sadiku</a></b> tolerated allied bandits' use of alcohol, drugs, and prostitution?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sadiku_(Boko_Haram)","retrieved":1772819819627},{"title":"Special Engineer Detachment (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a href=\"/wiki/John_D._Hoffman\" title=\"John D. Hoffman\">John D. Hoffman</a> of the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Special_Engineer_Detachment\" title=\"Special Engineer Detachment\">Special Engineer Detachment</a></b> was awarded the <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier%27s_Medal\" title=\"Soldier's Medal\">Soldier's Medal</a>, the US Army's highest non-combat decoration and the only one given to a member of the <a href=\"/wiki/Manhattan_Project\" title=\"Manhattan Project\">Manhattan District</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_Engineer_Detachment","retrieved":1772819819628},{"title":"Mark Williams (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Williams_(snooker_player)\" title=\"Mark Williams (snooker player)\">Mark Williams</a></b> did his press conference naked after winning the <a href=\"/wiki/2018_World_Snooker_Championship\" title=\"2018 World Snooker Championship\">2018 World Snooker Championship</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Williams_(snooker_player)","retrieved":1772819819628},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r452356